{"seq":1,"slug":"full-fine-tuning","title":"全量微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/fine-tuning/full-fine-tuning","wordCount":981,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"全量微调\">全量微调</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>全量微调的核心概念决定了它「什么时候值得用」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全量微调</strong>：更新模型全部参数、不冻结任何层，理论上能最大化对目标任务的适应能力。</li>\n<li><strong>可训练参数比例</strong>：全量微调是 100%，LoRA 约 0.1-1%——这个比例是显存和效果的直接杠杆。</li>\n<li><strong>有效 batch size</strong>：由 <code>per_device_train_batch_size × gradient_accumulation_steps</code> 决定，小显存靠梯度累积凑大 batch。</li>\n<li><strong>学习率与灾难性遗忘</strong>：学习率过大导致模型丧失预训练通用能力，过小则收敛慢，典型范围 1e-5 ~ 5e-5。</li>\n<li><strong>显存构成</strong>：参数 + 梯度 + 优化器状态 + 激活值；7B 模型全量微调约需 100GB，通常需多卡并行。</li>\n<li><strong>梯度检查点</strong>：用约 30% 速度代价换取 60-70% 的激活值显存节省，是 7B+ 模型几乎必须开启的选项。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一篇的主线是**「效果上限 vs 资源门槛」的权衡**：全量微调上限更高，但灾难性遗忘、显存成本与数据需求都随之上升，多数实际场景落在 LoRA/QLoRA 这一侧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是全量微调\">什么是全量微调</h2><p>全量微调（Full Fine-Tuning）是指更新模型的全部参数以适应特定任务或领域。与参数高效微调（PEFT）不同，全量微调不冻结任何层，理论上能够最大化模型对目标任务的适应能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;预训练模型&lt;br/&gt;所有参数&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;全部更新&quot;| B[&quot;微调后模型&lt;br/&gt;所有参数&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;预训练模型&lt;br/&gt;所有参数&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;部分更新&quot;| D[&quot;PEFT 模型&lt;br/&gt;冻结大部分参数&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"预训练模型&lt;br/&gt;所有参数\"] --&gt;|\"全部更新\"| B[\"微调后模型&lt;br/&gt;所有参数\"]\n    C[\"预训练模型&lt;br/&gt;所有参数\"] --&gt;|\"部分更新\"| D[\"PEFT 模型&lt;br/&gt;冻结大部分参数\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"何时使用全量微调\">何时使用全量微调</h2><p>全量微调并非总是最佳选择。以下是决策参考：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大量高质量领域数据（&gt;100K）</td>\n<td>全量微调</td>\n<td>充分利用数据调整所有参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>少量数据（&lt;10K）</td>\n<td>LoRA/QLoRA</td>\n<td>防止过拟合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算资源有限</td>\n<td>LoRA/QLoRA</td>\n<td>显存需求低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要最佳性能</td>\n<td>全量微调</td>\n<td>上限更高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速迭代实验</td>\n<td>LoRA</td>\n<td>训练速度快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多任务部署</td>\n<td>LoRA</td>\n<td>可热切换适配器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, TrainingArguments, Trainer&#10;&#10;model_name = &quot;meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B&quot;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    model_name,&#10;    torch_dtype=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)&#10;&#10;total_params = sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters())&#10;trainable_params = sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters() if p.requires_grad)&#10;print(f&quot;总参数量: {total_params / 1e9:.2f}B&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;可训练参数: {trainable_params / 1e9:.2f}B&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;可训练比例: {trainable_params / total_params * 100:.1f}%&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, TrainingArguments, Trainer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    device_map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total_params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p.numel() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.parameters())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainable_params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p.numel() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.parameters() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.requires_grad)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"总参数量: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total_params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"可训练参数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainable_params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"可训练比例: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainable_params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据需求\">数据需求</h2><p>全量微调对数据的质量和数量有较高要求：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 数据量级参考&#10;        S[&quot;&lt; 1K 条&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;⚠️ 高过拟合风险&quot;| R1[&quot;用 LoRA&quot;]&#10;        M[&quot;1K - 50K 条&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;✅ 合理范围&quot;| R2[&quot;可全量微调&quot;]&#10;        L[&quot;50K - 1M 条&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;✅ 理想范围&quot;| R3[&quot;全量微调最佳&quot;]&#10;        XL[&quot;&gt; 1M 条&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;⚠️ 考虑继续预训练&quot;| R4[&quot;CPT + SFT&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 数据量级参考\n        S[\"&lt; 1K 条\"] --&gt;|\"⚠️ 高过拟合风险\"| R1[\"用 LoRA\"]\n        M[\"1K - 50K 条\"] --&gt;|\"✅ 合理范围\"| R2[\"可全量微调\"]\n        L[\"50K - 1M 条\"] --&gt;|\"✅ 理想范围\"| R3[\"全量微调最佳\"]\n        XL[\"&gt; 1M 条\"] --&gt;|\"⚠️ 考虑继续预训练\"| R4[\"CPT + SFT\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"training_config = {&#10;    &quot;per_device_train_batch_size&quot;: 4,&#10;    &quot;gradient_accumulation_steps&quot;: 8,&#10;    &quot;effective_batch_size&quot;: 4 * 8,&#10;    &quot;learning_rate&quot;: 2e-5,&#10;    &quot;num_train_epochs&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;warmup_ratio&quot;: 0.1,&#10;    &quot;weight_decay&quot;: 0.01,&#10;    &quot;lr_scheduler_type&quot;: &quot;cosine&quot;,&#10;    &quot;bf16&quot;: True,&#10;    &quot;gradient_checkpointing&quot;: True,&#10;}&#10;&#10;for key, value in training_config.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;{key:40s}: {value}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">training_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"per_device_train_batch_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"gradient_accumulation_steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"effective_batch_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"learning_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"num_train_epochs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"warmup_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"weight_decay\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"lr_scheduler_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cosine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"bf16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"gradient_checkpointing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key, value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> training_config.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:40s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"关键超参数\">关键超参数</h2><p>全量微调的超参数选择对最终效果影响巨大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超参数</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习率</td>\n<td>1e-5 ~ 5e-5</td>\n<td>太大导致灾难性遗忘，太小收敛慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Batch Size</td>\n<td>32 ~ 128 (有效)</td>\n<td>通过梯度累积实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Epoch 数</td>\n<td>1 ~ 5</td>\n<td>SFT 通常 1-3 轮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预热比例</td>\n<td>5% ~ 10%</td>\n<td>稳定训练初期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重衰减</td>\n<td>0.01 ~ 0.1</td>\n<td>正则化防止过拟合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def cosine_schedule(step, total_steps, warmup_steps, lr_max, lr_min=0):&#10;    if step &lt; warmup_steps:&#10;        return lr_max * step / warmup_steps&#10;    progress = (step - warmup_steps) / (total_steps - warmup_steps)&#10;    return lr_min + 0.5 * (lr_max - lr_min) * (1 + np.cos(np.pi * progress))&#10;&#10;total_steps = 1000&#10;warmup_steps = 100&#10;lr_max = 2e-5&#10;&#10;for step in [0, 50, 100, 500, 900, 1000]:&#10;    lr = cosine_schedule(step, total_steps, warmup_steps, 